#: data/five-or-more-preferences.ui:87
msgid "B_ackground color:"
msgstr "B_ackground colour:"

#: data/org.gnome.five-or-more.appdata.xml.in:8
#: data/org.gnome.five-or-more.desktop.in:4
msgid "Remove colored balls from the board by forming lines"
msgstr "Remove coloured balls from the board by forming lines"

#: data/org.gnome.five-or-more.appdata.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Five or More is the GNOME port of a once-popular computer game. Align five "
"or more objects of the same color into a line to cause them to disappear and "
"score points. Earn many more points by lining up as many objects as possible "
"before clearing them."
msgstr ""
"Five or More is the GNOME port of a once-popular computer game. Align five "
"or more objects of the same colour into a line to cause them to disappear "
"and score points. Earn many more points by lining up as many objects as "
"possible before clearing them."

